For this example, we'll use `@angular/material` for UI components like `MatTreeGrid`, which is not officially part of core Angular but can be used via npm packages.

Install the necessary packages:

```bash
npm install @swimlane/ngx-treegrid @swimlane/ngx-charts mat-datetime-pickers mat-calendar mat-tdp-datepicker --save
```

